{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>And I will remember My covenant.</b> It draws itself and another after it. So too וזכרתי את בריתי את ברית יעקב (and I will remember My covenant, the covenant of Jacob) is like והנבואה עודד הנביא (and the prophecy of Oded the prophet), which is like והנבואה נבואת עודד הנביא (and the prophecy was the prophecy of Oded the prophet); ראשיכם שבטיכם (your heads, your tribes), which is ראשיכם ראשי שבטיכם (your heads are the heads of your tribes). The Gaon [Saadia] said that the reason Jacob is mentioned first is because all his years were in the covenant."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:52.482145209Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}